      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article aims to describe lung volume reduction (LVR) and some aspects of perioperative care. LVR is a surgical treatment for emphysema. An understanding of the operation and the patient's pre-existing medical condition is important for skilled and appropriate care, particularly in anaesthetic and recovery rooms."},
